From 62e2705c728038566638acdb133dd717fb064d2a Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Langsdorff <131063968+clangsdorff@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Thu, 19 Nov 2026 17:08:53 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] wm: start gamespace sessions for listed games

GameSpace waits for a session start, but lineage has no code that
sends it, so the game bar never shows up. Add a system service that
watches the focused app, starts the GameSpace session service when an
app from gamespace_game_list comes to front and stops it when the game
leaves or the keyguard shows. Ported from crDroid without its charge
bypass and perf boost bits.
